  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我只告诉\n光临本店的客人……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA544A8BC9000A51494E34672C5E9776845BA24EBA2026202600100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……意外得到了\n不得了的东西。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621120262026610F59165F9752304E86000A4E0D5F974E8676844E1C897F300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是通称<U+E300>10万咖啡的\n极训咖啡所使用的豆子当中……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n至高无上的那种。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F901A79F0E300003100304E07549655617684000A67818BAD5496556162404F7F752876848C465B505F534E2D2026202600100001BE00000A81F39AD865E04E0A768490A379CD300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能采摘的地点特别少，\n能采到的量也特别少。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD91C764587684573070B97279522B5C11FF0C000A80FD91C75230768491CF4E5F7279522B5C11300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是依靠宝可梦才能勉强采到的豆子！\n这豆子是顶级当中的至高无上级。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4F9D97605B9D53EF68A6624D80FD52C95F3A91C7523076848C465B50FF01000A8FD98C465B50662F98767EA75F534E2D768481F39AD865E04E0A7EA7300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "堪称百年一遇的优质豆子！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "582A79F0767E5E744E00904776844F188D288C465B50FF0100100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……您有兴趣吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202660A8670951748DA35417FF1F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没有",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA167090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您顶多也就适合喝\n<U+E300>10万的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A89876591A4E5F5C3190025408559D000AE300003100304E07768454965561300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……一杯<U+E300>100万。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264E00676FE3000031003000304E07300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果您真的感兴趣，并且不会后悔的话，\n那就请下单吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60A8771F7684611F51748DA3FF0C5E764E144E0D4F1A540E609476848BDDFF0C000A90A35C318BF74E0B53555427300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您是来喝百年一遇的\n通称“极训特选”的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8662F6765559D767E5E744E0090477684000A901A79F0201C67818BAD72799009201D768400100001BE00000A8D8551E198767EA77CBE90097A7667815496556176845417FF1F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 2
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您顶多也就适合喝\n<U+E300>10万的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A89876591A4E5F5C3190025408559D000AE300003100304E07768454965561300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "居然拿不出<U+E300>100万……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您顶多也就适合喝\n<U+E300>10万的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C45713662FF4E0D51FAE3000031003000304E072026202600100001BE01000A60A89876591A4E5F5C3190025408559D000AE300003100304E07768454965561300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您真的确定吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您是有资格喝<U+E300>100万的咖啡的人吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把钱用在这里您不会后悔吗？\n就算喝了，您能品出味道吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8771F7684786E5B9A5417FF1F00100001BE01000A60A8662F67098D44683C559DE3000031003000304E0776845496556176844EBA5417FF1F00100001BE01000A628A94B1752857288FD991CC60A84E0D4F1A540E60945417FF1F000A5C317B97559D4E86FF0C60A880FD54C151FA547390535417FF1F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确定",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E5B9A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "品出味道可不仅仅是\n能辨认味道而已。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n还包括理解<U+E300>100万的咖啡相关的食材、\n调制方法等背景知识。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您确定能品出<U+E300>100万的咖啡的味道吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我能",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621180FD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您能用自己的语言描述\n<U+E300>100万的咖啡的味道吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“有<U+E300>100万的味道……”\n如果是这种感言可算不上是描述哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您只是想炫耀\n自己喝了<U+E300>100万的咖啡吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我喝！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211559DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花上<U+E300>100万……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是只说出拙劣的感想，\n就会成为一辈子的耻辱哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n即使如此，您还是要喝\n这杯通称“极训特选”的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我喝！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211559DFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我再确认最后一次。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n您确定要喝这杯百年一遇的\n通称“极训特选”的……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211518D786E8BA46700540E4E006B21300200100001BE01000A60A8786E5B9A8981559D8FD9676F767E5E744E0090477684000A901A79F0201C67818BAD72799009201D76842026202600100001BE01000A8D8551E198767EA77CBE90097A766781549655615417FF1F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我喝！！！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211559DFF01FF01FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那股坚定不移的觉悟……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可以说您确实有资格\n喝这杯百年一遇……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n通称“极训特选”的\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A380A1575A5B9A4E0D79FB768489C9609F2026202600100001BE01000A53EF4EE58BF460A8786E5B9E67098D44683C000A559D8FD9676F767E5E744E0090472026202600100001BE01000A901A79F0201C67818BAD72799009201D7684000A8D8551E198767EA77CBE90097A766781549655615427300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚刚试探了您，\n实在是太抱歉了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A521A8BD563A24E8660A8FF0C000A5B9E5728662F592A62B16B494E86300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我现在就给您端过来，\n请好好品尝味道。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621173B057285C317ED960A87AEF8FC76765FF0C000A8BF7597D597D54C15C1D54739053300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请享用通称“极训特选”的\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74EAB7528901A79F0201C67818BAD72799009201D7684000A8D8551E198767EA77CBE90097A76678154965561300200100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我喝",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211559D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要做心理准备",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981505A5FC3740651C659070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "百年一遇的\n通称“极训特选”的……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n超凡顶级精选究极咖啡，\n味道如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767E5E744E0090477684000A901A79F0201C67818BAD72799009201D76842026202600100001BE01000A8D8551E198767EA77CBE90097A76678154965561FF0C000A5473905359824F55FF1F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无可比拟的幸福体验",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E053EF6BD462DF76845E78798F4F539A8C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "极致的香气与回味",
